cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "CrooksJarzynskiLean: a Lean 4 formalization of the Crooks and Jarzynski fluctuation theorems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "kiyo-e"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kiyo-e/CrooksJarzynskiLean"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - stochastic thermodynamics
  - fluctuation theorems
  - Crooks theorem
  - Jarzynski equality
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked development of finite-state, discrete-time stochastic
  thermodynamics in Lean 4: the pathwise Crooks fluctuation theorem, the
  work-distribution Crooks theorem, the Jarzynski equality, the integral
  fluctuation theorem, and the average-work second law, with an explicit
  physical time-reversal protocol, an exact comparison of discrete-time work
  conventions, and a path-uniform O(1/N) refinement limit for their
  discrepancy. No sorry placeholders or custom axioms.
